  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scholarships Programme Operational Management Phase 2: Education New Zealand Delivers Interim State</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity,&#xA0;following on from the Scholarships Improvement Project and Outsource Phase 1: Transition, aims to have&#xA0;the Manaaki New Zealand Scholarships Programme operationally managed by Education New Zealand in its interim state until the future state has been fully designed.&#xA0;The deployment of improvements that move the MNZSP towards its future state will be considered during this time.</narrative>
  </description>
